        "Id1": {
            "text": "Darinka Dentcheva was born on January 1st, 1958. She is a mathematician working in the field of mathematical optimization, and is known for her work with stochastic programming. One of her theories was influenced by Andrzej Piotr Ruszczy\u0144ski. She is a citizen of the United States and resides in New Jersey."
        },
